returns a `std::string_view` with a field type's name; both can be used
standalone, e.g. `TiffCraft::toString(TiffCraft::Tag::ImageWidth)`. Stream
operators (`operator<<`) are provided for `Header`, `IFD::Entry`, `IFD`, and
`TiffImage` (as well as `Tag` and `Type`), so any of those can be written
directly to `std::cout`; they are found via ADL from the `TiffCraft`
namespace.
